      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Specificity marking the evolution and clinical picture of acoustic neurinoma in persons of advanced age is described. A great interest of the cases under study consists in that quite often the clinical picture and the course of the disease in this age category are atypical, this being due to the age of the patients and intercurrent, most often vascular diseases of the brain."},
